[{"title":"完节堂","author":"庄昶","text":"玉镜空台一片秋，古风高月也全收。\n兔园何自须眉地，篱落遮阑补未周。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11389,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓台图","author":"庄昶","text":"领得尧夫七尺纶，白头终荡五湖春。\n千罾宁也鱼难得，断不移舟下孟津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11390,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红梅","author":"庄昶","text":"春雨东风色未寒，杏花曾笑北人看。\n若除牝牡骊黄论，只恐南人认亦难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11391,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"庄昶","text":"溪云十亩一瓜园，谁识山中此破轩。\n伊吕巢由还认错，老怀天地共谁言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11392,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛亥大寒梁塘道中有作 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"春暖秋凉自不难，梅花何爱雪边看。\n自知不及尧夫老，今日梁塘是大寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11393,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛亥大寒梁塘道中有作 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"冻云江路本知难，山是山人分所看。\n自裹木棉粗破衲，老夫何怕北风寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11394,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乐道斋诗定山居士为彭世英书世英十过定山所得止此昔东坡鬻马方叔不免更鬻然于此纸世英岂待一过宿哉世英之戚必有此纸者尚亦知世英之不易得也","author":"庄昶","text":"此妙人间各自真，天机流动静中春。\n谁知庭草才拈后，犹有高谈隔壁人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11395,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈天趣梅花禽鸟卷","author":"庄昶","text":"花鸟閒寻雪半枝，瘦筇拈到酒醒时。\n莫言无极乾坤妙，只许濂溪一老知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11396,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琴鹤双清卷","author":"庄昶","text":"一笑乾坤道眼馀，尽将琴鹤认鸢鱼。\n老夫霅水昆山坐，莫道舟中妙不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11397,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松风梅月为孤鹤翁作","author":"庄昶","text":"云影天光拈仲晦，溪声山色舞东坡。\n四千八万今如此，我问先生意若何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11398,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"素庵为萧贵赞作","author":"庄昶","text":"平生本质今如此，老去未能污一毫。\n俯仰仲尼磨不磷，百年天地鬓萧骚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11399,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘振之挽卷徐子仁题曰惜才","author":"庄昶","text":"百年涂抹皆成学，吴郡徐霖正惜才。\n安得不虚生死话，梦中呼起振之来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11400,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画和韵","author":"庄昶","text":"滚滚云山荡此身，不知何物更疏亲。\n年来我问天峰阁，笑恐回头错应人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11401,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"僧一庵","author":"庄昶","text":"云在青天水在瓶，古僧何处说今僧。\n一庵若问真何一，昨夜庵中火是灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11402,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰石","author":"庄昶","text":"流水香风乱石中，随花傍柳与人同。\n不知皇极书成否，莫问天津击壤翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11403,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张子如寻梅诗","author":"庄昶","text":"梅花一笑有无间，消息徒将问定山。\n是水是云皆是树，老夫驴背送君还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11404,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"江亭自笑读何书，此意乾坤忽有馀。\n四十四年痴老病，梅花才见是鸢鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11405,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"天机谁与漏春痕，独写梅花到石根。\n老子欲收元气坐，直从开阖看乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11406,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹为五叔父作","author":"庄昶","text":"多少金相玉质温，百年高节老乾坤。\n凭谁欲把栽培问，个个清风是子孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11407,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画马 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"苜蓿空山恋肯肥，性龙骨马本相违。\n古今分定庖羲眼，伯乐虽看认恐非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11408,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画马 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"野草寒风捲雪乾，病躯斜阁瘦阑干。\n相逢刍豆人间者，谁把行天步骤看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11409,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴抚州 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"深山忝窃旧相知，既别还胜未别时。\n老梦秋来如不到，静中閒看浴云池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11410,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴抚州 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"万古人心万古真，续骚亭上续骚人。\n閒来莫笑山中坐，不是前年活水春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11411,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴抚州 其三","author":"庄昶","text":"县桃台柏已无休，五马金溪亦细侯。\n知我尚多狂妄意，有人大刻在黄州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11412,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和盛文元 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"花鸟人间本自妍，相争出手肯徒然。\n机心已与狂夫尽，不对棋枰二十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11413,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和盛文元 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"人间万事有渊源，六籍谁闻是出言。\n画本不教花样乱，后来人说盛文元。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11414,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄祭酒林先生 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"狂谬无端似病风，少年此处几人同。\n如今万事消磨尽，甘做乾坤一病翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11415,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄祭酒林先生 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"问简山林敢自迂，岂知霄汉与樵渔。\n果看忘世真忘否，又写三山祭酒书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11416,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"今年雨中盛文元又至","author":"庄昶","text":"细雨疏篱晚菊边，茅斋又坐盛文元。\n作诗写字閒无用，相与山中一醉眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11417,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弘治三年秋七月喜雨有作 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"一拜甘霖一滴春，山中念念几斯民。\n往年记得填沟泪，犹有僧堂粥外人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11418,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弘治三年秋七月喜雨有作 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"满放天瓢浩荡春，一年饭碗尽吾民。\n如今万事无高眼，国虑天心到几人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11419,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弘治三年秋七月喜雨有作 其三","author":"庄昶","text":"蓑笠焚香祝帝春，任人嘲笑是何民。\n深山若有为霖者，肯作田头拜雨人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11420,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弘治三年秋七月喜雨有作 其四","author":"庄昶","text":"旱到双泉也半春，四方还有桔槔民。\n而今有饭家家饱，才满峰头活水人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11421,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画菜为杨黄门作 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"人间何处觅虚空，曾点源头路未穷。\n若把邵家楼阁看，士夫风味只涪翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11422,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画菜为杨黄门作 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"百可亭中虽自浅，千红堆里本非深。\n南园若与前川别，不是乾坤万物心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11423,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客有妄解余笑恐回头错应人之句者用韵 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"一发云何是一身，不知吾父是谁亲。\n寒山莫把钟敲破，或有姑苏不睡人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11424,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客有妄解余笑恐回头错应人之句者用韵 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"此人元本是天身，何物人间看不亲。\n却笑南泉无大手，不知还有热瞒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11425,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一山为张子如作","author":"庄昶","text":"乾坤万物见非私，万古谁言不子思。\n我却是山山是我，于今要与一山知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11426,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斗山杂诗","author":"庄昶","text":"渔蓑烂舞钓船中，谁遣先生此梦同。\n偶到南湖看月色，元来天地亦高风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11427,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禅者王福省号觉庵余不知禅何以应福省聊据已见塞白然乎否哉太虚老僧千眼观音当一照我 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"莽将觉悟了心传，坐透鸢鱼自在天。\n我亦鸢鱼中坐看，此身元是碧圆圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11428,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禅者王福省号觉庵余不知禅何以应福省聊据已见塞白然乎否哉太虚老僧千眼观音当一照我 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"一坐蒲团几百功，浑沦打破作圆通。\n腐儒只欲泥君窍，万古仍收混沌中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11429,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽诗","author":"庄昶","text":"刚道生姜树上生，百年奄忽可须惊。\n若知戌亥天还老，万里秋空月自明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11430,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"严陵钓台","author":"庄昶","text":"东汉云台迹已休，万年风节在羊裘。\n西来定是桐江水，不与漳河一处流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11431,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"传俸","author":"庄昶","text":"袖手功名二十收，乾坤何处不公侯。\n钓台昨夜因君舞，舞破蓑衣未肯休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11432,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"跋山谷墨迹","author":"庄昶","text":"老涪一笑古风天，宋雅堂堂二百年。\n点尽白头山阁雨，为谁聊泊太湖船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11433,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"植松为叶掌教作","author":"庄昶","text":"欲效人间长养功，霜根数寸了春风。\n何时肯作羲皇梦，送与浮云十八公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11434,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一松","author":"庄昶","text":"英风伟格动高寒，一盖堂堂万古看。\n养得茯苓天味别，我来丸作正心丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11435,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽人","author":"庄昶","text":"世间白发不容见，善恶老天难与言。\n未必张生真夭绝，请从周易论贞元。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11436,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南安张太守评白沙诗集有请予折衷之言","author":"庄昶","text":"风花醉点个中春，谁与痴人说梦频。\n问我折衷张太守，而今我亦是痴人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11437,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瑞鹊为周六合作","author":"庄昶","text":"白发青天一笑中，龟书龙马古今同。\n凭谁说与周夫子，我亦人间卖兔翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11438,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"庄昶","text":"千溪鸾凤舞苍空，虚直分明是此中。\n玉振许谁知万古，白头天下领清风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11439,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友兰为林处士作","author":"庄昶","text":"天伴真香空谷里，老人刚好结深期。\n回看桃李诸儿女，莫怪平生梦不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11440,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"庄昶","text":"午鹄随春得化工，碧桃花缀牡丹红。\n乾坤又把庖羲眼，分付先生半醉中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11441,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缉熙子为潘二教作","author":"庄昶","text":"在我文王肯未如，天光元本透真虚。\n老生更与提公案，静坐何须更读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11442,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方山道中","author":"庄昶","text":"万物此中元活脱，眼前何处不流行。\n去年记得方山路，甘雨和风说大程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11443,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈瑞山水画","author":"庄昶","text":"万里江山陈瑞画，白头开眼定山村。\n谁人得与青天阔，独有孤帆岛树痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11444,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"作小车成何子完诸友有诗和之 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"康节车儿且共閒，万花扶得几翁还。\n定山也有飞云顶，不是罗浮别有山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11445,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"作小车成何子完诸友有诗和之 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"人间何处问忙閒，黑发天涯白发还。\n认得玉台巾样好，先生须爱玉台山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11446,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种瓜","author":"庄昶","text":"巧拙天心自不差，人间分付各生涯。\n白头如此深山里，我不种瓜谁种瓜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11447,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"庄昶","text":"如此风云际会辰，丈夫谁肯负经纶。\n我知茅屋深山者，多是人间老病人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11448,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹名曰石泉清节张司寇求","author":"庄昶","text":"老凤虞周万古同，霜梢能事尽苍空。\n谁知水石空山意，也到金声玉振中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11449,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游定山寺和司马提学","author":"庄昶","text":"古邑天留众壑幽，小溪随步领真秋。\n源头水到相忘处，也恋天光不肯流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11450,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泉上请司马赋诗","author":"庄昶","text":"如斯山水客如斯，满眼鸢鱼活动时。\n欲了相逢千古意，先生只索要吟诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11451,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华亭张博父子持司马书来且有求教之说于其别也诗以送之 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"乾坤一劄到何深，两夜梅花许卧林。\n老我白头肝肺在，此心之外更无心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11452,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华亭张博父子持司马书来且有求教之说于其别也诗以送之 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"古今父子蔡西山，君在西山父子间。\n千古路头休认错，海涯风月看君还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11453,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古愚卷为白沙乃兄作","author":"庄昶","text":"箪瓢许与静中春，万古天留此味真。\n若道老兄甘起倒，石斋夫子是何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11454,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"可亭","author":"庄昶","text":"谁将无可仲尼心，来向人间可处寻。\n我亦欲凭无可可，古今天地共吾襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11455,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花仙子和韵","author":"庄昶","text":"梅花几点天心妙，太极濂溪认果真。\n莫只花神惟只汝，先生今也是花神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11456,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月宫仙子和韵","author":"庄昶","text":"山河影子无还有，玉兔嫦娥幻与真。\n我欲虚空都打碎，老夫拄杖捷如神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11457,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游平湖南寺","author":"庄昶","text":"绿阴撑入傍湖州，水作清深树作幽。\n是画不知还是寺，晚峰斜日更登楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11458,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄寿州廖同府","author":"庄昶","text":"家鸡到处不须争，醉点风花亦有情。\n我见白头张汝弼，今年又在寿春城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11459,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答定山僧","author":"庄昶","text":"山僧问我梅花妙，何事无诗只笑看。\n万物本知梅一我，老夫今日对谁谈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11460,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"古今世态本无穷，只在千红万紫中。\n他日肯将调鼎意，白头分付各春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11461,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"看到梅花眼莫狂，梅花狂岂易商量。\n而今莫把林逋笑，犹有林逋识暗香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11462,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其三","author":"庄昶","text":"梅花明月写天机，写到无诗乃是诗。\n若说无诗还错否，邵尧夫也不能知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11463,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其四","author":"庄昶","text":"笑把梅花醉一歌，九方皋奈简斋何。\n溪云老子糊涂甚，尽说庖羲一画多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11464,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折桂图","author":"庄昶","text":"蟾宫何说到荒唐，和月连根句偶狂。\n识得吾心真桂否，不劳扳折自天香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11465,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰","author":"庄昶","text":"猗兰楚楚各溪春，乱叶香风本自真。\n莫道伏羲难再见，出门何处不同人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11466,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]